      "id": "on-the-right",
      "pattern": "الـ[Noun] + عَلَى الـ[Direction]",
      "exampleArabic": "المكتب على اليمين",
      "exampleTransliteration": "al-maktabu ʿalā l-yamīni",
      "exampleEnglish": "The office is on the right.",
      "grammarNote": "Nothing new grammatically — عَلَى ('on', level 5) plus a definite noun works exactly as it always has. This level is vocabulary only: يَمِين/يَسَار ('right'/'left') for everyday directions, and the four compass points شَمَال/جَنُوب/شَرْق/غَرْب ('north'/'south'/'east'/'west') for the bigger picture.",
      "audio": { "id": "phrase_almaktab_alaa_alyameen", "text": "المكتب على اليمين" },
      "introducedInLevel": 72
    }
  ],
